<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hellfire</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 32)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hellfire &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast hellfire</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The second of the dark knight's fires: flames from below engulf the target. 
The better your divine power and your skill in the spell, the more it burns. Unlike lava flow, it 
burns hardest against plate and chain, and least against clothes (only the 
most powerful casts hurt all armour alike). A 
shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting. 
It is also found on staffs, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Lava Flow</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Brimstone</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Soulfire</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fire Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>